WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.183
A shopper picks products, and a checkout turns them into a paid order.

00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:09.310
This video shows why the cart and the checkout exist, how their steps

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:13.163
fit together, and how to use every screen, from the mini cart to

00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:16.190
the order confirmation and the checkout settings.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.938
Most lost sales happen between choosing a product and paying for it.

00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:30.150
The shopper wants to keep what they picked, change their mind, and pay without a fight.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.722
The cart holds what a shopper picked, for guests and for signed-in customers,

00:00:35.722 --> 00:00:37.930
and always shows today's prices.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:43.039
The checkout is one guided path with numbered steps, a running order summary,

00:00:43.039 --> 00:00:45.350
and the payment method of your choice.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.412
The same checkout takes the payment for every purchase, and the result is

00:00:50.412 --> 00:00:52.050
an order you can follow.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:00.137
The Carts module adds Add to cart to every product that can be

00:01:00.137 --> 00:01:03.910
bought online, a mini cart that slides out, and a cart page.

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.806
The Checkout module takes over from the cart.

00:01:07.806 --> 00:01:13.850
Its steps are Contact, Shipping and Payment, and each shows only when the purchase needs it.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:18.946
A promotion code, a gift card, store credit or points can pay part

00:01:18.946 --> 00:01:23.050
of the order, and the order summary shows what is left to pay.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.962
Settings, Commerce, Checkout and Customers choose how the checkout looks and what it

00:01:28.962 --> 00:01:32.060
asks, and Checkout details adds your own fields.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:40.279
On the shop, each product that can be bought online shows Add to

00:01:40.279 --> 00:01:42.071
cart, with a quantity box.

00:01:42.071 --> 00:01:47.110
Click it, and the mini cart slides out with the product, its price and the subtotal.

00:01:47.592 --> 00:01:53.197
Remove takes a product out, Checkout starts the payment, and View cart opens the whole cart.

00:01:53.197 --> 00:01:56.972
The Cart link in the header shows how many items are inside.

00:01:57.452 --> 00:02:01.032
Close it, add one more product, and open the cart.

00:02:01.032 --> 00:02:05.380
Each line shows the SKU, the price of one, a quantity box with

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:08.322
Update, and a button to remove the line.

00:02:08.799 --> 00:02:11.050
The Summary shows the subtotal.

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:16.770
Discounts and taxes are worked out at checkout, so the cart always shows today's prices.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.779
Click Checkout to continue.

00:02:22.957 --> 00:02:26.334
The checkout has numbered steps across the top:

00:02:26.334 --> 00:02:28.628
Contact, Shipping and Payment.

00:02:28.628 --> 00:02:34.237
A finished step shows a check mark, and the order summary stays beside every step.

00:02:34.714 --> 00:02:39.016
On the Contact step, enter the Full name and the Email, where the

00:02:39.016 --> 00:02:40.894
order's details are sent.

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:42.894
A Phone number is optional.

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:46.304
A Billing address is optional by default.

00:02:46.304 --> 00:02:52.271
It starts with the country, and then lays itself out the way that country writes addresses.

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:53.563
Click Continue.

00:02:57.852 --> 00:03:00.758
The Shipping step asks where the order goes.

00:03:00.758 --> 00:03:05.407
Choose the Country, then enter the name, the street address, the city, the

00:03:05.407 --> 00:03:07.092
state and the ZIP code.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:19.294
Click Continue, and the ways to ship the order there appear, each with what it costs.

00:03:19.294 --> 00:03:22.490
They come from the shipping zone the address is in.

00:03:23.058 --> 00:03:24.921
Choose Standard shipping.

00:03:24.921 --> 00:03:29.608
Click Continue, and the order summary adds a shipping line to the total.

00:03:33.819 --> 00:03:38.095
On the Payment step, each Payment method is a large button, and only

00:03:38.095 --> 00:03:41.330
the methods that can pay for this order are shown.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:46.009
On a test site, Test payment confirms the payment without moving any money.

00:03:46.477 --> 00:03:50.075
The Promotion code box sits under the order summary.

00:03:50.075 --> 00:03:53.487
Enter a code, such as WELCOME10, and click Apply.

00:03:53.939 --> 00:03:57.558
The summary lists the discount, and Due now is lower.

00:03:57.558 --> 00:03:59.889
Remove takes the code off again.

00:04:00.348 --> 00:04:01.478
Click Pay now.

00:04:01.478 --> 00:04:05.773
While the payment is taken the button reads Processing, and when it is

00:04:05.773 --> 00:04:09.108
confirmed, the buyer lands on the order confirmation.

00:04:09.562 --> 00:04:13.778
The confirmation says Thank you, and shows the Order number, with a link

00:04:13.778 --> 00:04:15.400
to view the order later.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.372
Below it is the order summary of what was bought.

00:04:22.575 --> 00:04:25.128
Open Settings, Commerce, Checkout.

00:04:25.128 --> 00:04:29.786
Checkout layout is A page per step, the default, or One page, which

00:04:29.786 --> 00:04:34.955
shows every step on one page and adds Payment once the others are complete.

00:04:35.413 --> 00:04:40.146
Settings, Commerce, Customers sets the Billing address at checkout:

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:42.286
Optional, Required, or Off.

00:04:42.286 --> 00:04:45.593
A checkout keeps the setting it started with.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:49.986
To ask buyers for something of your own, such as a gift message,

00:04:49.986 --> 00:04:55.427
turn on the Checkout details feature, then add fields to the Checkout details content type.

00:04:55.427 --> 00:04:58.680
They appear under Order details on the Contact step.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.131
Guest checkout:

00:05:04.131 --> 00:05:08.182
a shopper gives a name and an email on the Contact step, pays,

00:05:08.182 --> 00:05:11.280
and optionally saves their details afterwards.

00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:14.102
A short path on a phone:

00:05:14.102 --> 00:05:18.730
One page puts every step on one page, with the summary below.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:20.677
Part payment:

00:05:20.677 --> 00:05:25.088
a gift card, store credit or points pay what they cover, and the

00:05:25.088 --> 00:05:27.420
rest is paid by another method.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:32.404
Digital goods and services skip the Shipping step on their own, and your

00:05:32.404 --> 00:05:36.040
own fields collect a gift message or a purchase order number.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:42.861
A cart that keeps what shoppers picked, and one checkout that takes every payment:

00:05:42.861 --> 00:05:45.326
that is how a product becomes an order.

00:05:45.326 --> 00:05:46.750
Thanks for watching.

